# Battery monitoring and power
#
# 6S Li-ion pack. Most thresholds came from Mission Planner "Initial Tune" (6S
# Li-ion selected). See ardupilot.md "Battery monitoring" and flight-platform.md.
#
# Monitor via ESC telemetry (9), NOT the FC analog input -- the FC current sense is
#   reads a fixed over-range voltage, cause unknown (#117). Volts/current arrive on
#   SERIAL8 (see 20-serial) from a custom-calibrated AM32 build: voltage ~1%,
#   current scale generic and unverified.  provenance: 954150979 2026-07-27;
#   [flight-platform.md; #117]
BATT_MONITOR,9
BATT_ESC_MASK,0
BATT_CAPACITY,8000
#
# Voltage thresholds (~3.20 / 3.10 / 3.00 V per cell on 6S). BATT_CRT_VOLT=18 is
#   toward the low end for sustained load -- raise slightly if it Lands early under
#   sag.  [ardupilot.md]
BATT_ARM_VOLT,19.2
BATT_LOW_VOLT,18.6
BATT_CRT_VOLT,18
BATT_LOW_MAH,0
BATT_CRT_MAH,250
BATT_LOW_TIMER,0
#
# Failsafe ACTIONS: RTL on both low and critical (2). Was Land (1), chosen for flight
#   under canopy, where RTL's climb-then-home is the wrong move. For overhead work RTL is
#   the safe action: Seth, 2026-11-07.  provenance: 2026-11-07
BATT_FS_LOW_ACT,2
BATT_FS_CRT_ACT,2
#
# Sag compensation: scale thrust between these pack voltages.  provenance: ac57658 2026-04-25
MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX,24.6
MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN,16.8
